flowchart TD
 U[Browser: text or image] --> N[Next.js /api/chat]
 P[(PostgreSQL chat history)] <--> N
 N --> R{Route and resolve context}
 R -->|clarify or general| O[Streamed chat output]
 R -->|new medical question| F[FastAPI canonical QA]
 R -->|same-topic follow-up| C[Next.js response composer]
 D[(Catalog + transcripts + local videos)] --> F
 V[Voyager Qwen: text and vision] <--> F
 F --> E[Evidence bundle + validated backend claims]
 E --> C
 K[Checked NHS / St John references] --> C
 V <--> C
 C --> O
 E --> M[Optional relevant clip + transcript]
 M --> U
 O --> U
